/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (Student Ambassador Tour Training: At the start of each school year, new ambassadors must learn how to give campus tours in an effective and accurate manner. This module will go over how this learning will take place and what ambassadors will be expected to learn and do. This training takes place yearly for each group of new ambassadors and adjustments can be made between each year. This will take into account feedback from the ambassador team to improve the program year over year.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
