<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (This learning experience will intentionally move learners through the learning process while allowing them to choose how they may best learn and what they want to focus on. Specific information will be given with purposeful intent, and skills will be built with support and guidance. The blueprint will create an environment where learners are supported by adult learning principles, leading to a learner-centric experience. Learning will be presented in real-world context to further support learning.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [0]
>>
